> =C2=A0
> =C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0 src_uri =3D (d.getVar('SRC_URI') or "").split()
>=20

Changing PREMIRRORS or MIRRORS should not change the output of the
task, ever, so do_fetch shouldn't depend upon them.

